        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Istanbul, Turkey, Sultanahmet Meydanı\n- Buildings and Sites: Gül Mosque, Hippodrome of Constantinople\n- Organizations and Cultures: Eastern Orthodox Church, Ottomans\n\nFacts:\n- Gül Mosque is in Istanbul, Turkey.\n- Gül Mosque is a former Eastern Orthodox church.\n- The Ottomans converted Gül Mosque into a mosque.\n- The Hippodrome of Constantinople is today a square named Sultanahmet Meydanı in Istanbul.\n- A few fragments of the original Hippodrome of Constantinople structure survive.",
